      "text": "tribulation to be sent upon wicked, D&C 29:8. be patient in tribulation until the Lord come, D&C 54:10. he who is faithful in tribulation will receive greater reward in heaven, D&C 58:2. tribulation to be followed by glory, D&C 58:3. after much tribulation come blessings, D&C 58:4 (103:12; 112:13). tribulation to descend upon Church, D&C 78:14. after much tribulation the Lord will feel after Twelve, D&C 112:13. if thou art called to pass through tribulation, it shall be for thy good, D&C 122:5–8. like Paul, Joseph Smith glories in tribulation, D&C 127:2. just suffered tribulation in the Redeemer’s name, D&C 138:13.",
